VUE_APP_DESCRIPTION=The Xiaozhi backend service (xiaozhi-server) is an intelligent terminal software and hardware backend system led by Professor Siyuan Liu's team at South China University of Technology. It is specially designed for xiaozhi-esp32 open-source hardware and features multi-protocol compatibility, voiceprint recognition, knowledge base management, and other core capabilities.
VUE_APP_KEYWORDS=xiaozhi-server, Xiaozhi backend, Smart Console, AI hardware, smart hardware, AI toys, emotional companion, chatbot, smart home, in-car robot
